{"id":"3ef46815f85bb26e","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-program-substitution-composition.md","title":"同时代入的复合、有限支持与新鲜改名","display":"lem-program-substitution-composition — 同时代入的复合、有限支持与新鲜改名","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-program-substitution-composition","aliases":["72-lem-program-substitution-composition"],"display":"lem-program-substitution-composition — 同时代入的复合、有限支持与新鲜改名","depends_on":["[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §2.5 and §5.1, print648,662/PDF660,674; local term induction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-program-substitution-composition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-program-substitution-composition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-program-substitution-composition — 同时代入的复合、有限支持与新鲜改名"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed15cbe9da0035aa\" href=\"?note=ed15cbe9da0035aa\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-substitution\">72-df-logic-program-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §2.5 and §5.1, print648,662/PDF660,674; local term induction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\delta,\\zeta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta,\\delta,\\zeta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 为项、关系字面量、goal 或子句，所有接口取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed15cbe9da0035aa\" href=\"?note=ed15cbe9da0035aa\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-substitution\">72-df-logic-program-substitution</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq V\">\\(W\\subseteq V\\)</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为子句；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 量化于由 V 的置换给出的有限支持代入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho[V]\">\\(\\rho[V]\\)</span> 表示其变量像。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\star\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma,\\qquad\nZ(\\theta\\star\\delta)=(Z\\theta)\\delta,\\qquad\n(\\theta\\star\\delta)\\star\\zeta=\\theta\\star(\\delta\\star\\zeta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta\\star\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma,\\qquad\nZ(\\theta\\star\\delta)=(Z\\theta)\\delta,\\qquad\n(\\theta\\star\\delta)\\star\\zeta=\\theta\\star(\\delta\\star\\zeta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ \\bigl[\\rho:V\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}V\\land\n\\operatorname{vars}(C\\rho)\\cap W=\\varnothing\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ \\bigl[\\rho:V\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}V\\land\n\\operatorname{vars}(C\\rho)\\cap W=\\varnothing\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>复合支持包含于 supp θ∪supp δ，因该并之外两次都保持变量。项树归纳证明复合与扩张交换，再逐构造推广到字面量、序列和子句；结合律由每个变量上的等式得到。子句变量及 W 都有限，可把子句中有限多个变量交换到避开两者的新变量，得到全 V 上有限支持置换。这保证标准化分离可实现，不把任意非单射代入都称为改名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-logic-program-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ed15cbe9da0035aa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ed15cbe9da0035aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta,\\delta,\\zeta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma$，$Z$ 为项、关系字面量、goal 或子句，所有接口取 [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta,\\delta,\\zeta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"W\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho[V]","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\star\\delta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma,\\qquad\nZ(\\theta\\star\\delta)=(Z\\theta)\\delta,\\qquad\n(\\theta\\star\\delta)\\star\\zeta=\\theta\\star(\\delta\\star\\zeta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ \\bigl[\\rho:V\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}V\\land\n\\operatorname{vars}(C\\rho)\\cap W=\\varnothing\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1942,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-195","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"bb7ab4318ec98937","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"4f8fbd6e08fa4850","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P$ 是有限确定程序，体仅含正关系原子；$G,H$ 是有限正原子序列。使用 [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] 和 [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-565","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"f97e4de0d3